# One item in each of the bag's eight pockets, so every pocket the run cycles
# through has something in it: an empty pocket draws the same "no items" page
# whichever one it is, and a station that cycled past eight of those would pin
# a picture that says nothing about which pocket it is on.

name BAGGER
gender GENDER_FEMALE
trainer-id 30116
money 12345
var VAR_PLAYER_STARTER SPECIES_CHIMCHAR
party SPECIES_MONFERNO 18 ITEM_NONE
item ITEM_ESCAPE_ROPE 3
item ITEM_POTION 7
item ITEM_POKE_BALL 12
item ITEM_TM24 1
item ITEM_ORAN_BERRY 5
item ITEM_GRASS_MAIL 2
item ITEM_X_ATTACK 4
item ITEM_BICYCLE 1
map MAP_HEADER_SOLACEON_TOWN 0x236 0x291 FACE_DOWN
